        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>美的集团ESG报告</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #e0e0e0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .document {\n    width: 1600px;\n    height: 1060px;\n    background-color: #fff;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 50px 80px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #999;\n    margin-bottom: 80px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .nav {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .nav-item {\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .nav-item.active {\n    color: #f3c300;\n    border: 1px solid #f3c300;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    padding: 2px 12px;\n  }\n  .content-area {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 100px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .column {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .left-col h1 {\n    color: #f3c300;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin: 0 0 40px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .left-col h2 {\n    color: #f3c300;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin: 60px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .right-col h2 {\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .right-col h2:not(:first-child) {\n    margin-top: 50px;\n  }\n  p {\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .highlight-box {\n    background-color: #fffdf5;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    margin: 40px 0;\n    height: 100px;\n  }\n  .highlight-label {\n    background-color: #f3c300;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 0 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .highlight-content {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 40px;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .highlight-text-group {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n  }\n  .highlight-text {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n  .highlight-number {\n    font-size: 56px;\n    color: #f3c300;\n    margin-left: 15px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .highlight-icon {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border: 1px dashed #ccc;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    background-color: #fff;\n  }\n  .illustration-placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 550px;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #ccc;\n    background-color: rgba(250, 250, 250, 0.8);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #999;\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n  .page-number.left {\n    left: 80px;\n  }\n  .page-number.right {\n    right: 80px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"document\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-left\">2024·美的集团ESG报告</div>\n    <div class=\"header-right nav\">\n      <span class=\"nav-item\">关于本报告</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-item\">走进美的</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-item\">可持续发展治理</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-item\">守护蓝色星球</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-item\">构建和谐社区</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-item\">践行科技尽善</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-item active\">共创繁荣生态</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-item\">附录</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-area\">\n    <div class=\"column left-col\">\n      <h1>自我成长 治理全面升级</h1>\n      <p>美的集团深知遵循法律法规是企业稳健发展的前提，而恪守商业道德和职业操守则是推动企业持续成长的核心。我们不断强化合规管理与文化体系，打造一个正直、透明的职场环境；我们不断优化反腐败和举报体系，致力于塑造一个阳光、正向的企业形象，以期成为行业典范，推动行业道德标准持续提升。</p>\n      \n      <h2>企业管治完善者</h2>\n      <p>董事会高效运作是战略决策与监督核心，投资者关系是价值沟通与资源整合基础，风险防控是全流程安全保障，三者协同共同构建可持续发展的治理闭环。</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"column right-col\">\n      <h2>董事会有效性</h2>\n      <p>我们坚信提升董事会运行有效性对美的集团的公司治理和业务运营至关重要。因此我们关注董事投入公司事务的时间和精力、董事技能培训、董事会构成及董事会绩效评估等事项。我们认为，董事会出席率能在一定程度上体现董事对公司事务的投入和关注，故在《美的集团股份有限公司章程》中将董事连续两次未能亲自出席、也不委托其他董事出席董事会会议的行为，视为董事不能履行职责；同时要求董事会召开时，应有过半数的董事出席。</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-label\">报告期内</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight-content\">\n          <div class=\"highlight-text-group\">\n            <span class=\"highlight-text\">每名董事于董事会会议出席率均为</span>\n            <span class=\"highlight-number\">100%</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"highlight-icon placeholder\">[Icon: Hands holding document]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <h2>投资者关系</h2>\n      <p>美的集团严格遵守其股票上市地信息披露相关法律法规，以及本公司发布的《美的集团股份有限公司章程》《美的集团股份有限公司信息披露管理办法》等制度，履行披露信息真实、准确、完整、及时、公平的承诺，明确和规范信息披露的职责、审议与披露信息流程等工作。美的集团信息披露工作已连续多年获得深圳证券交易所A级评价。</p>\n      <p>我们高度重视与投资者的互动和关系的维护，通过美的集团官方网站投资者关系专栏、线上交流会、“互动易”平台等多种方式与投资者进行沟通，广泛倾听并积极回应他们的关注。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"illustration-placeholder placeholder\">\n    [Isometric Illustration: Spanning bottom of both pages, showing office, recycling, wind turbines, solar panels, and \"Midea\" logo]\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number left\">111</div>\n  <div class=\"page-number right\">112</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
